Z||000003||Gokart||11-08-1999||07:12 PM||||I've seen much worse! I painted my first Fiero twice. The first time teal and it was nicknamed "runs"! The 2nd time it came out much better when I painted it raspberry red metallic. At least the trim wasn't painted over, I've seen alot of Fieros painted and the trim was never masked off! ||||reg||6
